# Generated voice-over. Reproducible with `pnpm generate:vo`, and deliberately
# not committed: edge-tts output comes from Microsoft's online speech service,
# which grants no redistribution licence (spec 20.5). ASSET_LICENSES.md rule 1
# says a non-redistributable asset ships as the script that makes it, not as the
# asset. The manifest at content/dialogue/vo-manifest.json *is* committed — it is
# our own data, and it is what makes regeneration incremental.
public/assets/audio/dialogue/

